# Real-data study evidence: raw pulled market data and per-run dumps are NOT versioned.
# They are reproducible from the documented pull scripts in each study's own README
# (TradingView / Robinhood MCP pulls; the pull date is recorded in every CSV header).
# Versioned instead: the study code, README/RESULTS/FINDINGS, the provenance logs,
# and the small hand-check fixtures under examples/logs/.
skills/*/*/examples/*/data/
skills/*/*/examples/*/out/
skills/*/*/examples/*/tradelogs/
skills/*/*/examples/*/engine-output/
